1
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:07,757
- [UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]
- [OVERLAPPING CHATTER]

2
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:15,181
[DINO] <i>Good evening, Ms. Billy.</i>

3
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:17,726
<i>We finally meet. I'm Dino.</i>

4
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:20,061
[BILLY] <i>There you go.</i>
<i>That's what you're asking for.</i>

5
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,480
<i>I'm not in a hurry.</i>

6
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:25,483
<i>But I won't decline either.</i>

7
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:30,613
<i>How can I be sure that</i>
<i>you will no longer bother me after this?</i>

8
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:33,241
<i>Ms. Billy, you have my word.</i>

9
00:00:33,324 --> 00:00:34,951
<i>You don't have to worry.</i>

10
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:37,245
<i>But you don't have a choice.</i>

11
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:39,622
<i>Because if I don't get this money home,</i>

12
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:42,792
<i>everyone will know that you're a criminal.</i>

13
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:49,716
<i>You know that I had nothing to do with</i>
<i>Jordan's mom's death. Right?</i>

14
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,843
[DINO] <i>Who do you think did it?</i>

15
00:00:52,761 --> 00:00:53,845
<i>Me?</i>

16
00:00:55,263 --> 00:00:56,598
<i>Where's your evidence?</i>

17
00:00:56,681 --> 00:00:57,849
<i>You've got nothing.</i>

18
00:00:59,434 --> 00:01:02,562
<i>So just be quiet and thankful</i>

19
00:01:02,645 --> 00:01:06,024
<i>that no one will ever know</i>
<i>that you're a murderer.</i>

20
00:01:07,275 --> 00:01:08,693
- [DINO GRUNTS]
<i>- Sorry, sir.</i>

21
00:01:08,777 --> 00:01:10,987
<i>What the heck?! Can you just move aside?!</i>

22
00:01:11,071 --> 00:01:13,156
<i>- Sir--</i>
<i>- Sir, what happened?</i>

23
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:15,075
<i>What-- I'm sorry, sir. Did you get wet?</i>

24
00:01:15,158 --> 00:01:16,534
<i>- I just want to go.</i>
<i>- Yes, sir.</i>

25
00:01:16,618 --> 00:01:18,328
<i>- Move!</i>
<i>- I'll pay for it.</i>

26
00:01:18,411 --> 00:01:20,288
<i>I just want to go! Move!</i>

27
00:01:21,581 --> 00:01:22,457
[KAREN IN VIDEO] <i>Well?</i>

28
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,666
<i>Tell me!</i>

29
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:26,169
<i>You killed Jade!</i>

30
00:01:26,252 --> 00:01:28,254
[DINO IN VIDEO]
<i>It was her fault.</i>

31
00:01:28,338 --> 00:01:29,881
<i>It was all her fault.</i>

32
00:01:30,965 --> 00:01:33,676
<i>Everything that happened</i>
<i>that day was Jade's fault.</i>

33
00:01:35,804 --> 00:01:38,890
<i>Jade was already dead</i>
<i>before she was run over?</i>

34
00:01:39,557 --> 00:01:42,393
<i>You killed your own wife?</i>

35
00:01:44,521 --> 00:01:46,815
<i>There's your evidence.</i>

36
00:01:46,898 --> 00:01:49,275
- [SCREAMING]
<i>- Evidence, huh?!</i>

37
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:51,194
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [SCREAMING]

38
00:01:51,277 --> 00:01:55,406
<i>- Jordan! Jordan, no!</i>
<i>- Dino!</i>

39
00:01:55,490 --> 00:01:56,866
<i>Jordan!</i>

40
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:58,243
<i>- Jordan!</i>
- [WOMAN] <i>Jordan!</i>

41
00:01:58,910 --> 00:02:00,578
<i>You killed my mom!</i>

42
00:02:01,204 --> 00:02:02,580
[DINO] <i>Jordan.</i>

43
00:02:02,664 --> 00:02:05,250
<i>- Jordan, son, I didn't mean to.</i>
<i>- Don't call me son!</i>

44
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:07,460
<i>I didn't mean for that to happen.</i>

45
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:10,296
<i>I didn't mean to hit her head!</i>

46
00:02:10,922 --> 00:02:12,674
<i>Jordan, she would've had me arrested!</i>

47
00:02:12,757 --> 00:02:14,676
<i>I didn't mean for that to happen.</i>

48
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:17,762
- [JORDAN GRUNTING]
- [BLOWS LANDING]

49
00:02:17,846 --> 00:02:19,055
[PANTING]

50
00:02:19,139 --> 00:02:22,308
<i>Is this what you want, huh?!</i>

51
00:02:22,892 --> 00:02:24,352
<i>For me to be like you?!</i>

52
00:02:25,353 --> 00:02:26,729
<i>Jordan, please.</i>

53
00:02:26,813 --> 00:02:28,648
<i>- I'm not done yet!</i>
<i>- Jordan, enough!</i>

54
00:02:28,731 --> 00:02:32,485
<i>I know! I know you're mad at him.</i>

55
00:02:32,569 --> 00:02:35,905
<i>But you've already gotten justice</i>
<i>for your mom.</i>

56
00:02:35,989 --> 00:02:37,907
<i>Look at me. Jordan.</i>

57
00:02:40,076 --> 00:02:43,413
<i>He will pay for everything he has done.</i>

58
00:02:43,496 --> 00:02:45,790
[SCREAMS]

59
00:02:50,628 --> 00:02:53,673
[JORDAN CRYING]

60
00:02:54,632 --> 00:03:00,805
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

61
00:03:59,197 --> 00:04:05,328
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

62
00:04:13,670 --> 00:04:14,587
<i>Billy.</i>

63
00:04:15,838 --> 00:04:18,049
<i>Uh… What are you doing here?</i>

64
00:04:18,132 --> 00:04:22,262
<i>You said you wanted to</i>
<i>prove yourself, right?</i>

65
00:04:23,554 --> 00:04:24,764
<i>Yes.</i>

66
00:04:24,847 --> 00:04:27,141
<i>Then do it now.</i>

67
00:04:27,225 --> 00:04:28,893
<i>Okay, but how?</i>

68
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:29,894
<i>Uh…</i>

69
00:04:29,978 --> 00:04:31,938
<i>What can I do? How can I help?</i>

70
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:36,567
<i>We need to get the attention</i>

71
00:04:37,527 --> 00:04:40,321
<i>of whoever is trying to blackmail me.</i>

72
00:04:41,823 --> 00:04:45,201
<i>And you have to earn their trust.</i>

73
00:04:45,285 --> 00:04:48,246
<i>Show them that you're mad at me</i>

74
00:04:48,329 --> 00:04:50,290
<i>and that you want me to get hurt.</i>

75
00:04:50,373 --> 00:04:51,666
<i>Huh?</i>

76
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:55,295
<i>But I'm not mad at you.</i>

77
00:04:55,378 --> 00:04:56,713
<i>How am I going to do that?</i>

78
00:04:56,796 --> 00:04:58,339
<i>Make yourself hate me again, Bea.</i>

79
00:05:03,303 --> 00:05:08,016
<i>LoveList isn't just a company.</i>
<i>We all know that.</i>

80
00:05:09,058 --> 00:05:12,395
<i>We worked hard for this.</i>
<i>This is our family.</i>

81
00:05:12,478 --> 00:05:15,898
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

82
00:05:16,649 --> 00:05:19,527
<i>So we will fight for it whatever it takes.</i>

83
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:23,823
<i>Chief.</i>

84
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:28,161
<i>Bea is here.</i>

85
00:05:28,244 --> 00:05:33,583
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

86
00:05:35,251 --> 00:05:37,211
<i>I asked her to come here.</i>

87
00:05:38,254 --> 00:05:40,715
<i>I have a favor to ask from all of you.</i>

88
00:05:42,008 --> 00:05:44,552
<i>And I need your cooperation on this.</i>

89
00:05:44,635 --> 00:05:47,513
<i>So, Bea and I will stage a fight.</i>

90
00:05:48,723 --> 00:05:50,892
<i>It needs to be convincing.</i>

91
00:05:51,601 --> 00:05:54,604
<i>Marj, Val, I want you to take a video.</i>

92
00:05:54,687 --> 00:05:58,483
<i>Upload it to a dummy account</i>
<i>and make sure it goes viral.</i>

93
00:06:08,743 --> 00:06:09,744
<i>Oh.</i>

94
00:06:10,244 --> 00:06:12,163
<i>What's a criminal doing here?</i>

95
00:06:13,289 --> 00:06:15,083
<i>Uh, Billy…</i>

96
00:06:15,166 --> 00:06:16,793
<i>I just wanted to make it clear</i>

97
00:06:16,876 --> 00:06:20,463
<i>that I have nothing to do with</i>
<i>the blackmail you're getting.</i>

98
00:06:21,506 --> 00:06:23,216
<i>I came here because…</i>

99
00:06:24,717 --> 00:06:26,260
<i>I want to help.</i>

100
00:06:26,344 --> 00:06:29,722
<i>I know that I've done you</i>
<i>and LoveList wrong.</i>

101
00:06:29,806 --> 00:06:31,891
<i>I'm not denying that.</i>

102
00:06:31,974 --> 00:06:34,227
<i>But I swear, this one isn't on me.</i>

103
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,187
<i>I just want to help.</i>

104
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:37,647
<i>You want to help me?</i>

105
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:41,317
<i>Yes. I'll do anything. Just tell me.</i>

106
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:43,778
<i>Wow!</i>

107
00:06:43,861 --> 00:06:46,614
<i>Let's give this liar a round of applause!</i>

108
00:06:46,697 --> 00:06:47,573
[EMPLOYEES CLAPPING]

109
00:06:47,657 --> 00:06:49,742
<i>Great acting!</i>

110
00:06:51,035 --> 00:06:54,747
<i>After all you've done,</i>
<i>you want to help me?</i>

111
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:56,082
<i>Why?</i>

112
00:06:56,165 --> 00:06:57,959
<i>To pretend that you've changed?</i>

113
00:06:58,042 --> 00:06:59,961
<i>Billy, that's not it.</i>

114
00:07:00,044 --> 00:07:03,881
<i>I want to help to prove to you</i>
<i>that I really have changed.</i>

115
00:07:03,965 --> 00:07:06,217
<i>No. You don't have to prove anything.</i>

116
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:08,511
<i>I won't believe anything you say anyway.</i>

117
00:07:08,594 --> 00:07:12,932
<i>The person you are right now?</i>

118
00:07:14,767 --> 00:07:16,102
<i>You're a nobody.</i>

119
00:07:16,185 --> 00:07:18,104
<i>And that's all you'll ever be.</i>

120
00:07:19,063 --> 00:07:20,231
<i>Billy, please believe me.</i>

121
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:23,025
<i>I don't mean any harm.</i>

122
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:27,029
<i>Is that so? Oh, all right!</i>

123
00:07:27,113 --> 00:07:30,324
<i>Let's list down all the things you did!</i>

124
00:07:31,367 --> 00:07:34,787
<i>First, you trespassed into our home.</i>

125
00:07:34,871 --> 00:07:35,997
<i>Do you remember?</i>

126
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,332
<i>Then you stole my shoes.</i>

127
00:07:39,333 --> 00:07:40,710
<i>God, Bea!</i>

128
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,420
<i>It was just shoes!</i>

129
00:07:42,503 --> 00:07:44,338
<i>You could've just asked me</i>
<i>to buy you a pair!</i>

130
00:07:44,422 --> 00:07:45,965
<i>What else did you steal?</i>

131
00:07:46,048 --> 00:07:47,884
<i>Oh, right. My LoveFeast idea.</i>

132
00:07:47,967 --> 00:07:50,470
<i>Also our list of investors.</i>

133
00:07:50,553 --> 00:07:54,557
<i>Then you blackmailed</i>
<i>one of our biggest investors!</i>

134
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,142
<i>And for what?</i>

135
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:58,686
<i>To bring our company to the ground?</i>

136
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:02,982
<i>To leave these employees without a job?</i>

137
00:08:03,065 --> 00:08:04,692
<i>That's her, everyone!</i>

138
00:08:04,775 --> 00:08:07,695
<i>The one who almost cost you your jobs!</i>

139
00:08:07,778 --> 00:08:09,614
<i>- Billy, that's enough.</i>
- [BILLY]<i> No!</i>

140
00:08:09,697 --> 00:08:11,324
<i>You wanted this, right?</i>

141
00:08:12,074 --> 00:08:13,618
<i>This is all you've ever wanted!</i>

142
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:17,955
<i>You put my life in danger.</i>

143
00:08:19,415 --> 00:08:21,667
<i>You put my family in danger.</i>

144
00:08:21,751 --> 00:08:24,504
<i>Even my friends. Even Jordan!</i>

145
00:08:24,587 --> 00:08:29,634
<i>My house burned down because of you</i>
<i>and your psychotic mother!</i>

146
00:08:31,552 --> 00:08:33,888
<i>Don't call my mother psychotic.</i>

147
00:08:33,971 --> 00:08:35,556
<i>Oh, but wait!</i>

148
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,642
<i>You know what's funny?</i>

149
00:08:37,725 --> 00:08:40,770
<i>That no matter how much</i>
<i>you try to get back at me,</i>

150
00:08:40,853 --> 00:08:43,439
<i>your mother still loves</i>
<i>your sister more than you.</i>

151
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:45,233
<i>Was it Abi?</i>

152
00:08:45,316 --> 00:08:46,609
<i>Abi, right?</i>

153
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:50,988
<i>The name you used to try and be like her?</i>

154
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:53,950
<i>But let's face it.</i>

155
00:08:56,327 --> 00:08:58,204
<i>You can steal her name.</i>

156
00:08:59,121 --> 00:09:00,957
<i>You can copy her life.</i>

157
00:09:03,417 --> 00:09:06,003
<i>But you will never be your sister.</i>

158
00:09:10,091 --> 00:09:12,426
<i>And you will never be me.</i>

159
00:09:14,178 --> 00:09:15,638
<i>Your "Billy Idol."</i>

160
00:09:15,721 --> 00:09:20,810
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

161
00:09:22,311 --> 00:09:24,021
<i>You're just Bea.</i>

162
00:09:24,939 --> 00:09:27,066
<i>The jealous Bea.</i>

163
00:09:27,733 --> 00:09:30,528
<i>The Bea who gets off</i>
<i>on ruining other people's lives</i>

164
00:09:30,611 --> 00:09:32,488
<i>because no one loves her.</i>

165
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:34,407
<i>Oh, no.</i>

166
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:36,784
<i>There's one person who loved you.</i>

167
00:09:36,867 --> 00:09:37,868
<i>Caloy.</i>

168
00:09:39,704 --> 00:09:41,747
<i>But he's gone now too,</i>
<i>also because of you!</i>

169
00:09:41,831 --> 00:09:43,165
<i>I said enough!</i>

170
00:09:44,917 --> 00:09:46,669
<i>You're crossing the line.</i>

171
00:09:46,752 --> 00:09:50,715
<i>Don't act like you never did</i>
<i>anything wrong in your life.</i>

172
00:09:50,798 --> 00:09:53,217
<i>I wanted to change and help,</i>
<i>but you refused.</i>

173
00:09:53,301 --> 00:09:57,138
<i>You'd rather I stay evil?</i>
<i>Well, all right, then.</i>

174
00:09:57,847 --> 00:09:59,599
<i>I'll give you what you want.</i>

175
00:10:00,808 --> 00:10:02,685
<i>And I'll make sure you regret it, Billy.</i>

176
00:10:05,646 --> 00:10:06,856
<i>Exciting!</i>

177
00:10:08,608 --> 00:10:10,359
<i>I can't wait.</i>

178
00:10:10,443 --> 00:10:16,449
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

179
00:10:36,469 --> 00:10:43,267
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

180
00:10:58,741 --> 00:11:05,748
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

181
00:11:23,599 --> 00:11:30,564
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

182
00:11:47,915 --> 00:11:54,922
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

183
00:12:12,231 --> 00:12:18,154
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

184
00:12:35,588 --> 00:12:42,511
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

185
00:13:00,905 --> 00:13:04,325
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

186
00:13:04,408 --> 00:13:05,367
<i>You're okay.</i>

187
00:13:05,993 --> 00:13:07,453
<i>You're her sister?</i>

188
00:13:08,913 --> 00:13:10,623
<i>Yes, I'm her sister.</i>

189
00:13:10,706 --> 00:13:14,752
<i>But whenever something happens to her,</i>

190
00:13:14,835 --> 00:13:17,046
<i>she blames it on me.</i>

191
00:13:17,129 --> 00:13:18,005
<i>Gosh.</i>

192
00:13:18,631 --> 00:13:19,798
<i>Wow.</i>

193
00:13:19,882 --> 00:13:22,551
<i>So it's true that Billy</i>
<i>really despises you.</i>

194
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:25,387
<i>She does. She made me and my mom suffer.</i>

195
00:13:25,471 --> 00:13:27,723
<i>That's why my mom is in prison right now.</i>

196
00:13:27,806 --> 00:13:31,602
<i>But now, it turns out that</i>
<i>she's also a criminal.</i>

197
00:13:33,395 --> 00:13:36,315
<i>So? Let me in on the gossip.</i>

198
00:13:36,398 --> 00:13:37,566
<i>Is it true?</i>

199
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:41,487
<i>Is Billy the one</i>
<i>who killed Jordan's mother?</i>

200
00:13:41,570 --> 00:13:42,821
<i>You're not listening.</i>

201
00:13:42,905 --> 00:13:46,033
<i>I already told you that it was her.</i>

202
00:13:46,116 --> 00:13:48,077
<i>Oh? Really?</i>

203
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,704
<i>How would I know? I mean,</i>
<i>what if it was fake?</i>

204
00:13:51,455 --> 00:13:53,916
<i>I thought you were on our side now.</i>

205
00:13:53,999 --> 00:13:55,709
<i>Why don't you believe my partner?</i>

206
00:13:55,793 --> 00:13:57,628
<i>Hey, it's not like that.</i>

207
00:13:57,711 --> 00:13:59,213
<i>I believe you.</i>

208
00:13:59,296 --> 00:14:02,716
<i>Of course, it works in my favor</i>
<i>if Billy is a criminal too.</i>

209
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,927
<i>I can't wait to get back at her.</i>

210
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:08,597
<i>She's such a horrible person.</i>
<i>She has a terrible attitude.</i>

211
00:14:09,515 --> 00:14:13,018
[BEA SIGHS] <i>Good thing I found you.</i>

212
00:14:13,102 --> 00:14:14,103
<i>Now I have allies.</i>

213
00:14:14,853 --> 00:14:15,854
<i>Cheers.</i>

214
00:14:15,938 --> 00:14:18,065
<i>Bea really is something else.</i>

215
00:14:18,148 --> 00:14:24,238
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

216
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:26,907
<i>We're on the same side, but remember,</i>

217
00:14:26,991 --> 00:14:29,118
<i>we're only allies up to Plan B.</i>

218
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:33,330
<i>Plan B will only push through</i>
<i>if our scheme falls apart.</i>

219
00:14:35,249 --> 00:14:37,334
<i>I'll send her a video and post it</i>

220
00:14:37,418 --> 00:14:39,587
<i>if she doesn't hold up</i>
<i>her end of the deal.</i>

221
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:42,464
<i>But since I like to play it safe…</i>

222
00:14:42,548 --> 00:14:44,884
<i>Fine, I'll go along with your plan.</i>

223
00:14:45,843 --> 00:14:47,761
<i>Especially now that</i>
<i>my partner is pregnant.</i>

224
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:51,807
<i>Pregnant?! Hey!</i>

225
00:14:51,891 --> 00:14:52,892
[CHUCKLES]

226
00:14:52,975 --> 00:14:54,768
[BEA] <i>Congratulations! Have a drink.</i>

227
00:14:55,644 --> 00:14:58,188
<i>Cheers! She's pregnant! That's great!</i>

228
00:14:58,272 --> 00:15:03,944
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

229
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:07,031
<i>Well then, that's our agreement, okay?</i>

230
00:15:07,114 --> 00:15:10,159
<i>We'll divide the jewelry</i>
<i>equally between us.</i>

231
00:15:10,242 --> 00:15:12,202
<i>- Okay?</i>
<i>- Equally?</i>

232
00:15:12,286 --> 00:15:13,454
<i>We'll do sixty-forty.</i>

233
00:15:13,537 --> 00:15:16,832
<i>You came to me</i>
<i>because you needed my help, right?</i>

234
00:15:16,916 --> 00:15:18,167
<i>That's unacceptable.</i>

235
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:21,253
<i>We're in the same boat,</i>
<i>but you refuse to be equal?</i>

236
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:24,924
<i>Whatever, just get out of here.</i>

237
00:15:25,007 --> 00:15:27,176
<i>Let's talk about your plan later.</i>

238
00:15:28,427 --> 00:15:29,637
<i>I'll look forward to that.</i>

239
00:15:30,304 --> 00:15:31,889
<i>Yeah, just go.</i>

240
00:15:31,972 --> 00:15:33,641
<i>Thank you, Dino.</i>

241
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:39,688
[SIGHS]

242
00:15:45,069 --> 00:15:47,446
<i>Dude, it's Bea.</i>

243
00:15:59,124 --> 00:16:00,834
[PHONE CHIMES]

244
00:16:10,094 --> 00:16:11,261
[KAREN ON RECORDING] <i>Wow.</i>

245
00:16:11,345 --> 00:16:13,806
<i>So it's true that Billy</i>
<i>really despises you.</i>

246
00:16:13,889 --> 00:16:17,142
[BEA]<i> She does.</i>
<i>She made me and my mom suffer.</i>

247
00:16:17,226 --> 00:16:19,478
<i>That's why my mom is in prison right now.</i>

248
00:16:20,187 --> 00:16:21,647
[KAREN] <i>Dino!</i>

249
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:23,065
<i>Dino, wait a minute!</i>

250
00:16:24,441 --> 00:16:26,443
<i>- Dino, wait!</i>
<i>- What are you doing here?</i>

251
00:16:26,527 --> 00:16:28,320
[KAREN] <i>Jordan was at our house.</i>

252
00:16:28,404 --> 00:16:29,405
[DINO]<i> Huh?</i>

253
00:16:29,488 --> 00:16:30,948
<i>How did he find out</i>
<i>where we live?</i>

254
00:16:31,031 --> 00:16:33,033
<i>- Is it true?</i>
<i>- What do you mean?</i>

255
00:16:33,117 --> 00:16:35,577
<i>He believes that you're the one</i>
<i>who killed his mother.</i>

256
00:16:36,203 --> 00:16:38,247
[KAREN] <i>Well? Is it true?</i>

257
00:16:38,330 --> 00:16:40,833
<i>Is that why you have her necklace?</i>

258
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:41,834
<i>Is it true?</i>

259
00:16:41,917 --> 00:16:43,460
[DINO] <i>Can you please just shut it?</i>

260
00:16:43,544 --> 00:16:45,087
<i>Just what are you talking about, huh?</i>

261
00:16:45,170 --> 00:16:46,880
<i>Tell me the truth.</i>

262
00:16:46,964 --> 00:16:48,966
<i>You killed your wife.</i>

263
00:16:49,049 --> 00:16:50,300
<i>Just admit it!</i>

264
00:16:51,343 --> 00:16:52,594
<i>Well?</i>

265
00:16:52,678 --> 00:16:54,263
<i>Tell me!</i>

266
00:16:54,888 --> 00:16:57,641
<i>Speak up! You killed Jade!</i>

267
00:16:57,725 --> 00:17:00,519
<i>You did, right? So you did kill her!</i>

268
00:17:00,602 --> 00:17:02,354
<i>- She pushed my patience!</i>
<i>- Huh?</i>

269
00:17:02,438 --> 00:17:03,897
<i>I had no other choice!</i>

270
00:17:03,981 --> 00:17:06,275
<i>Everything that happened</i>
<i>that day was Jade's fault.</i>

271
00:17:06,358 --> 00:17:08,110
<i>It was all her fault!</i>

272
00:17:09,737 --> 00:17:12,322
<i>Jade was already dead</i>
<i>before she was run over?</i>

273
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:16,368
<i>You killed your own wife?</i>

274
00:17:17,578 --> 00:17:19,997
<i>Do you think I wanted that to happen?</i>

275
00:17:20,748 --> 00:17:22,708
<i>Do you think it was my plan to kill Jade?</i>

276
00:17:24,543 --> 00:17:26,545
<i>She pushed me to the edge that day.</i>

277
00:17:27,504 --> 00:17:30,799
<i>If she hadn't pushed me like that,</i>
<i>she'd still be alive today.</i>

278
00:17:34,178 --> 00:17:36,180
<i>What are you going to do now?</i>

279
00:17:36,263 --> 00:17:38,807
<i>Are you going to send me</i>
<i>to jail again? Is that it?</i>

280
00:17:41,393 --> 00:17:43,187
<i>No, no.</i>

281
00:17:44,313 --> 00:17:45,522
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

282
00:17:46,523 --> 00:17:48,901
<i>Sorry. I won't do it again.</i>

283
00:17:50,611 --> 00:17:52,529
<i>I promise you I won't hurt you.</i>

284
00:17:52,613 --> 00:17:54,907
<i>Just… I just need to do this.</i>

285
00:17:55,616 --> 00:17:58,535
<i>Once I get the money from Billy,</i>
<i>we'll leave.</i>

286
00:17:58,619 --> 00:18:00,454
<i>Let's go somewhere far away.</i>

287
00:18:01,121 --> 00:18:02,539
<i>We'll start a new life.</i>

288
00:18:04,583 --> 00:18:06,001
<i>Just please let me do this.</i>

289
00:18:08,337 --> 00:18:09,671
<i>Don't go back home either.</i>

290
00:18:12,174 --> 00:18:13,717
[DINO] <i>Just wait for me over there.</i>

291
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:16,637
<i>I'll just finish this,</i>
<i>and then we'll leave.</i>

292
00:18:17,888 --> 00:18:19,098
<i>Just let me do this.</i>

293
00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:25,854
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

294
00:18:40,828 --> 00:18:42,162
[PHONE CHIMES]

295
00:18:42,246 --> 00:18:47,626
[STIRRING MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

296
00:19:07,062 --> 00:19:09,481
Make way, please!

297
00:19:09,565 --> 00:19:11,191
- What happened?
- Move back, please.

298
00:19:11,275 --> 00:19:13,485
[OFFICER 1] Move aside!

299
00:19:13,569 --> 00:19:17,865
- [MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]
- [INDISTINCT CHATTER]

300
00:19:17,948 --> 00:19:20,325
Go home! Go!

301
00:19:20,409 --> 00:19:22,536
[STRETCHER RATTLING]

302
00:19:29,376 --> 00:19:31,879
[OFFICER 1] We're done here.
Go home, everyone!

303
00:19:31,962 --> 00:19:33,463
[OFFICER 2] Step back! Step back!

304
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:39,428
<i>The manhunt for Dino Valentin</i>
<i>has finally come to an end.</i>

305
00:19:39,511 --> 00:19:43,599
<i>He was identified as the real killer</i>
<i>of his wife, Jade Valentin.</i>

306
00:19:43,682 --> 00:19:46,894
<i>Dino and Jade Valentin are the parents</i>

307
00:19:46,977 --> 00:19:51,648
<i>of rising singer, entrepreneur,</i>
<i>and IT expert Jordan Valentin.</i>

308
00:19:59,114 --> 00:20:03,952
[STIRRING MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

309
00:20:04,036 --> 00:20:06,622
- [MUSIC FADES]
- [BIRDS CHIRPING]

310
00:20:10,918 --> 00:20:14,671
[PENSIVE MUSIC
PLAYING]

311
00:20:14,755 --> 00:20:17,674
FUGITIVE DINO VALENTIN ARRESTED

312
00:20:17,758 --> 00:20:19,176
EVERYTHING'S JUST A PUBLICITY STUNT.

313
00:20:26,516 --> 00:20:31,355
[PENSIVE MUSIC
CONTINUES]

314
00:20:31,438 --> 00:20:37,611
THIS CLOUT CHASER
IS SO DESPERATE TO TREND!

315
00:20:37,694 --> 00:20:44,368
CAN'T THEY JUST SHUT UP FOR ONCE?
ALWAYS STIRRING UP SOMETHING!

316
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:51,833
<i>Publicity stunt? Really?</i>

317
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:54,378
<i>A wanted fugitive</i>
<i>was caught, guys.</i>

318
00:20:54,461 --> 00:20:56,838
<i>He blackmailed Billy</i>
<i>and killed Jordan's mother.</i>

319
00:20:56,922 --> 00:20:58,632
<i>That's not a marketing campaign.</i>

320
00:20:58,715 --> 00:21:00,300
<i>That's a crime.</i>

321
00:21:00,384 --> 00:21:02,469
<i>And she helped bring justice.</i>

322
00:21:02,552 --> 00:21:05,847
<i>I doubt a CEO would get herself</i>
<i>involved in a murder case</i>

323
00:21:05,931 --> 00:21:07,266
<i>just for clout.</i>

324
00:21:07,349 --> 00:21:10,269
<i>Wake up, haters. Use your brains.</i>

325
00:21:10,352 --> 00:21:17,234
[MUSIC TURNS HOPEFUL]

326
00:21:20,279 --> 00:21:24,825
<i>So, we're redefining what LoveList means.</i>

327
00:21:24,908 --> 00:21:29,246
<i>Before, we helped our users</i>
<i>find "the right one."</i>

328
00:21:29,329 --> 00:21:32,916
<i>Now, I want LoveList to be with our users,</i>

329
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,251
<i>not just at the start,</i>

330
00:21:34,334 --> 00:21:36,670
<i>but through every stage</i>
<i>of their love lives,</i>

331
00:21:36,753 --> 00:21:40,674
<i>whether healing from a heartbreak,</i>

332
00:21:40,757 --> 00:21:43,135
<i>or finding the courage to date again.</i>

333
00:21:43,218 --> 00:21:48,056
<i>I just want to apologize again for what</i>
<i>I did to your daughter and Precious.</i>

334
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:49,057
<i>Mariela.</i>

335
00:21:50,142 --> 00:21:54,354
<i>I'll apologize to you over</i>
<i>and over. Remember that.</i>

336
00:21:54,438 --> 00:21:58,233
<i>It's enough for me that both of you</i>
<i>are on good terms now.</i>

337
00:21:59,151 --> 00:22:01,570
<i>Take care of each other, okay?</i>

338
00:22:02,195 --> 00:22:04,865
<i>And you? Are you doing well?</i>

339
00:22:05,907 --> 00:22:07,284
<i>I'm doing great, Ma.</i>

340
00:22:07,367 --> 00:22:09,578
<i>If you're still hurt,</i>

341
00:22:09,661 --> 00:22:12,497
<i>or if every now and then,</i>

342
00:22:12,581 --> 00:22:16,209
<i>you're still affected</i>
<i>by the history of betrayal,</i>

343
00:22:17,878 --> 00:22:21,631
<i>if you can't help but question</i>
<i>that person's sincerity,</i>

344
00:22:22,382 --> 00:22:25,385
<i>I'm telling you, that's normal.</i>

345
00:22:25,469 --> 00:22:27,721
[BEA] <i>I have wronged you</i>
<i>in so many ways.</i>

346
00:22:28,305 --> 00:22:32,809
<i>I used the anger that filled my heart</i>

347
00:22:34,978 --> 00:22:37,105
<i>and manipulated you to do my bidding.</i>

348
00:22:39,357 --> 00:22:40,692
<i>In the end,</i>

349
00:22:42,861 --> 00:22:44,738
<i>I led you here.</i>

350
00:22:58,168 --> 00:23:00,462
[BOTH CHUCKLING]
